# Source workbooks are NOT committed.
# Both files carry third-party licence restrictions (TSX Group Inc. and Refinitiv
# are the recorded creators) and embedded personal data: each records a named
# last modifier, the whitespace workbook carries cell comments authored by a
# named employee, and the LSEG screen contains a sheet of named partners,
# client contacts and free-text notes on client responses.
# See docs/design/11-security-privacy-compliance.md.
reference/
*.xlsx
*.xlsb
*.xlsm

